  "sourceIssues": [
    "The summary table states 47 courses, but its own category rows add up to 46 (16 + 5 + 5 + 4 + 15 + 1), and the semester plan lists 46 courses including elective slots. Credit hours agree: 138.",
    "CS-354 Digital Logic Design is printed as 4 (2+1): the theory + practical breakdown (3) does not match the total (4). Stored as printed. The semester II total (18) is consistent with 4 credits.",
    "The semester VIII total line is labelled \"Total Credits for Semester - VII\" in the source; the value (12) is the semester VIII total.",
    "CS-552 is titled \"Advance Database Management Systems\"; BSSE uses \"Advanced\". Stored as printed.",
    "CS-657 Internship is printed as 3 (3+0), while BSAI prints Internship as 3 (0+3). Stored as printed.",
    "Elective slots CS-xxx have no official course code; they are stored as slots linked to their elective pool, not as courses.",
    "Domain Elective-1 and Domain Elective-2 (semester VI) are printed with total credits only (3), no breakdown."
